re supplementary. \n\n$$\nm∠DOE+m∠DOC={180}^{∘}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the measure of $∠DOC$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m∠DOC & ={180}^{∘}-m∠DOE \\\\  & ={180}^{∘}-{67}^{∘} \\\\  & ={113}^{∘}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-4000a1f5-32a2-5471-9f90-0bfc3b4839fd"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-4000a1f5-32a2-5471-9f90-0bfc3b4839fd" :answer-field/id #uuid "4000a1f5-32a2-5471-9f90-0bfc3b4839fd" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-7ca6621c-07b4-5673-90fb-156c9dd985c2" :answer-field/choices ["answer-7ca6621c-07b4-5673-90fb-156c9dd985c2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7ca6621c-07b4-5673-90fb-156c9dd985c2" :answer/id #uuid "7ca6621c-07b4-5673-90fb-156c9dd985c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "113" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-f0518b35-857c-5bdb-a223-e7f6be6165f2" :question/id #uuid "f0518b35-857c-5bdb-a223-e7f6be6165f2" :question/math-academy-id "q-237185" :question/problem "![](images/78/78d588198d35e69ca7ae2b199dd52d2c07e5c9d3268214821b737deffe5cb03d.png)\n\nGiven that $\\overset{―}{CE}$ is a segment, what is the measure of $∠BOE?$\n\n$m∠BOE=$\n{{field-1}}${}^{∘}$" :question/worked-solution "![](images/d3/d3ba77dd51c7d26685246304088d484144f5dcda57c424656ae305cc2ffa78ae.png)\n\nTwo angles are supplementary if their measures add up to ${180}^{∘},$ a straight angle.\n\nSince $\\overset{―}{CE}$ is a segment, we have that $∠COB$ and $∠BOE$ are supplementary. \n\n$$\nm∠COB+m∠BOE={180}^{∘}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the measure of $∠BOE$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m∠BOE & ={180}^{∘}-m∠COB \\\\  & ={180}^{∘}-{47}^{∘} \\\\  & ={133}^{∘}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-bb22d846-456e-5766-8b0e-26165fc31370"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-bb22d846-456e-5766-8b0e